{"【日志直证】明确状态迁移后，超过 15 秒仍重复出现相反的 start_call/net_connected 心跳（180 秒内至少两次）。【推断】可能有多个实例/日志流；无 PID，无法确定实例数量或逐行归属。","[Log evidence] After an explicit transition, opposite start_call/net_connected heartbeats continued beyond 15 seconds, at least twice within 180 seconds. [Inference] Multiple instances/log streams are possible; without PID, instance count and row ownership remain unknown.",L"【日志直证】明确状态迁移后，超过 15 秒仍重复出现相反的 start_call/net_connected 心跳（180 秒内至少两次）。【推断】可能有多个实例/日志流；无 PID，无法确定实例数量或逐行归属。",L"[Log evidence] After an explicit transition, opposite start_call/net_connected heartbeats continued beyond 15 seconds, at least twice within 180 seconds. [Inference] Multiple instances/log streams are possible; without PID, instance count and row ownership remain unknown."},
{"按 PID/启动标识分别采集日志，并核对守护进程是否重复拉起；不要把这些心跳解释成同一实例反复迁移，也不要跨启动拼接停留时长。","Collect logs by PID/startup identifier and check for duplicate daemon starts. Do not interpret these heartbeats as repeated transitions of one instance or combine dwell time across starts.",L"按 PID/启动标识分别采集日志，并核对守护进程是否重复拉起；不要把这些心跳解释成同一实例反复迁移，也不要跨启动拼接停留时长。",L"Collect logs by PID/startup identifier and check for duplicate daemon starts. Do not interpret these heartbeats as repeated transitions of one instance or combine dwell time across starts."},
