{"【日志直证】Net disconnected 回调已纳入旧格式未归因计数；原始原因码不能证明是应用主动停止或 SDK 自发断开，回调区间也不等于业务中断区间。","[Log evidence] Net disconnected callbacks count as unattributed legacy events. Raw reason codes do not distinguish intentional application stops from spontaneous SDK disconnects; callback intervals do not establish business outage intervals.",L"【日志直证】Net disconnected 回调已纳入旧格式未归因计数；原始原因码不能证明是应用主动停止或 SDK 自发断开，回调区间也不等于业务中断区间。",L"[Log evidence] Net disconnected callbacks count as unattributed legacy events. Raw reason codes do not distinguish intentional application stops from spontaneous SDK disconnects; callback intervals do not establish business outage intervals."},
{"结合对应 Net Connected、业务探测和 RX 判断恢复；未识别业务断网不意味着业务 100% 可用，概览和报告按证据不足展示。","Review Net Connected, business probes and RX. No recognized outage does not establish 100% availability; overview and reports show insufficient evidence.",L"结合对应 Net Connected、业务探测和 RX 判断恢复；未识别业务断网不意味着业务 100% 可用，概览和报告按证据不足展示。",L"Review Net Connected, business probes and RX. No recognized outage does not establish 100% availability; overview and reports show insufficient evidence."},
