{"核对同一时段的 CEREG/CGREG stat、LAC/CI/AcT、SIM 状态和运营商覆盖；","Review CEREG/CGREG stat, LAC/CI/AcT, SIM state and coverage for the same period. ",L"核对同一时段的 CEREG/CGREG stat、LAC/CI/AcT、SIM 状态和运营商覆盖；",L"Review CEREG/CGREG stat, LAC/CI/AcT, SIM state and coverage for the same period. "},
{"复位反复出现时优先查注册条件，而不是继续缩短复位周期。","If resets recur, investigate registration conditions before shortening reset intervals.",L"复位反复出现时优先查注册条件，而不是继续缩短复位周期。",L"If resets recur, investigate registration conditions before shortening reset intervals."},
{"连续 ping 失败触发重初始化","Consecutive ping failures triggered reinitialization",L"连续 ping 失败触发重初始化",L"Consecutive ping failures triggered reinitialization"},
{"v2 的 keepalive 重试次数已经达到配置上限，源码随后将状态转入 MD_ERROR，","v2 keepalive retries reached the configured limit; source transitions to MD_ERROR ",L"v2 的 keepalive 重试次数已经达到配置上限，源码随后将状态转入 MD_ERROR，",L"v2 keepalive retries reached the configured limit; source transitions to MD_ERROR "},
{"重新执行模组初始化；单条 ping failed(x/y) 不会触发本结论。","and reinitializes the module. A single ping failed(x/y) does not trigger this finding.",L"重新执行模组初始化；单条 ping failed(x/y) 不会触发本结论。",L"and reinitializes the module. A single ping failed(x/y) does not trigger this finding."},
{"结合 WAN down/up 断网区间和 CSQ/CEREG 指标判断是覆盖、注册还是数据面故障；","Use WAN down/up windows and CSQ/CEREG to distinguish coverage, registration and data-plane faults. ",L"结合 WAN down/up 断网区间和 CSQ/CEREG 指标判断是覆盖、注册还是数据面故障；",L"Use WAN down/up windows and CSQ/CEREG to distinguish coverage, registration and data-plane faults. "},
{"若频繁重初始化，保留完整周期日志。","Retain full-cycle logs if reinitialization recurs.",L"若频繁重初始化，保留完整周期日志。",L"Retain full-cycle logs if reinitialization recurs."},
{"进入 READY 时 WAN 仍离线","WAN offline on entry to READY",L"进入 READY 时 WAN 仍离线",L"WAN offline on entry to READY"},
