{"该行证明当时尚未联网，但不等同于进程初始化失败。","This proves connectivity was absent then, but does not establish process initialization failure.",L"该行证明当时尚未联网，但不等同于进程初始化失败。",L"This proves connectivity was absent then, but does not establish process initialization failure."},
{"查看随后是否出现 WAN ping OK；若持续离线，再结合注册状态和 SIM/CSQ 证据处理。","Check for later WAN ping OK. If offline persists, investigate registration and SIM/CSQ evidence.",L"查看随后是否出现 WAN ping OK；若持续离线，再结合注册状态和 SIM/CSQ 证据处理。",L"Check for later WAN ping OK. If offline persists, investigate registration and SIM/CSQ evidence."},
{"READY 状态失败并复位","READY state failed and reset",L"READY 状态失败并复位",L"READY state failed and reset"},
{"日志出现 failed to in ready state，表明状态机从 MD_READY 进入错误处理并调用模组复位。","failed to in ready state shows a transition from MD_READY to error handling and module reset.",L"日志出现 failed to in ready state，表明状态机从 MD_READY 进入错误处理并调用模组复位。",L"failed to in ready state shows a transition from MD_READY to error handling and module reset."},
{"回看此前连续 ping、WAN online、CEREG/CGREG 与 CSQ；区分网络不可达和模组/AT 端口异常。","Review preceding ping failures, WAN online, CEREG/CGREG and CSQ. Distinguish network reachability from module/AT-port faults.",L"回看此前连续 ping、WAN online、CEREG/CGREG 与 CSQ；区分网络不可达和模组/AT 端口异常。",L"Review preceding ping failures, WAN online, CEREG/CGREG and CSQ. Distinguish network reachability from module/AT-port faults."},
{"IMX6ULL 拨号失败，已进入退避重试","IMX6ULL dial failure entered backoff retry",L"IMX6ULL 拨号失败，已进入退避重试",L"IMX6ULL dial failure entered backoff retry"},
{"【源码直证】旧版以 FAILURE/RETRY 记录退避；1.25.1 以 RECOVERY 的 class、level、","[Source-code evidence] Older versions record backoff under FAILURE/RETRY; 1.25.1 records the same action under RECOVERY using class, level, ",L"【源码直证】旧版以 FAILURE/RETRY 记录退避；1.25.1 以 RECOVERY 的 class、level、",L"[Source-code evidence] Older versions record backoff under FAILURE/RETRY; 1.25.1 records the same action under RECOVERY using class, level, "},
