{"检查接口是否存在、udhcpc 进程与租约、IP/网关/路由/DNS；再复核探测端点可达性。","Check interface existence, udhcpc, lease, IP/gateway/routes/DNS, then probe-endpoint reachability.",L"检查接口是否存在、udhcpc 进程与租约、IP/网关/路由/DNS；再复核探测端点可达性。",L"Check interface existence, udhcpc, lease, IP/gateway/routes/DNS, then probe-endpoint reachability."},
