{"检查 USB 枚举、option 驱动绑定、AT 端口节点及供电；确认网卡与 AT 口来自同一模组。","Check USB enumeration, option driver binding, AT nodes and power. Confirm the interface and AT port belong to the same module.",L"检查 USB 枚举、option 驱动绑定、AT 端口节点及供电；确认网卡与 AT 口来自同一模组。",L"Check USB enumeration, option driver binding, AT nodes and power. Confirm the interface and AT port belong to the same module."},
