{"该字段本身不等同 AT 端口完全不可用；新版会另以 at_probe 或 [AT] 基础探测确认。","This alone does not establish total AT-port failure; newer versions confirm with at_probe or an [AT] basic probe.",L"该字段本身不等同 AT 端口完全不可用；新版会另以 at_probe 或 [AT] 基础探测确认。",L"This alone does not establish total AT-port failure; newer versions confirm with at_probe or an [AT] basic probe."},
{"查看同一心跳的 at_probe 及后续 [AT] timeout event；probe=ok 时优先保留现场观察，","Review at_probe and subsequent [AT] timeout events. With probe=ok, retain evidence and observe; ",L"查看同一心跳的 at_probe 及后续 [AT] timeout event；probe=ok 时优先保留现场观察，",L"Review at_probe and subsequent [AT] timeout events. With probe=ok, retain evidence and observe; "},
