{"查看证据中的 path/retained、probe_ms、process_elapsed_ms 和 boot_ms；开机时长与墙钟时间分别解释。","Review path/retained, probe_ms, process_elapsed_ms and boot_ms. Interpret boot duration separately from wall-clock time.",L"查看证据中的 path/retained、probe_ms、process_elapsed_ms 和 boot_ms；开机时长与墙钟时间分别解释。",L"Review path/retained, probe_ms, process_elapsed_ms and boot_ms. Interpret boot duration separately from wall-clock time."},
{"RK3506J 模组关机/上电未确认","RK3506J module shutdown/power-on unconfirmed",L"RK3506J 模组关机/上电未确认",L"RK3506J module shutdown/power-on unconfirmed"},
{"【日志直证】CFUN 软关机未确认、PWRKEY 脉冲操作失败或关机结果不明；源码可能跳过300秒上电冷却。","[Log evidence] CFUN shutdown unconfirmed, PWRKEY pulse failed or shutdown outcome unknown. Source may skip the 300-second power-on cooldown.",L"【日志直证】CFUN 软关机未确认、PWRKEY 脉冲操作失败或关机结果不明；源码可能跳过300秒上电冷却。",L"[Log evidence] CFUN shutdown unconfirmed, PWRKEY pulse failed or shutdown outcome unknown. Source may skip the 300-second power-on cooldown."},
{"核对具体失败步骤与后续 USB/AT 枚举；不能将未确认关机或允许硬恢复当作已完成物理断电。","Review the exact failed step and subsequent USB/AT enumeration. Unconfirmed shutdown or allowed hard recovery is not completed physical power-off.",L"核对具体失败步骤与后续 USB/AT 枚举；不能将未确认关机或允许硬恢复当作已完成物理断电。",L"Review the exact failed step and subsequent USB/AT enumeration. Unconfirmed shutdown or allowed hard recovery is not completed physical power-off."},
{"RK3506J 选网事务失败或结果未验证","RK3506J operator-selection transaction failed or unverified",L"RK3506J 选网事务失败或结果未验证",L"RK3506J operator-selection transaction failed or unverified"},
{"【日志直证】CFUN/手动选网/查询事务未完成，或历史/候选 PLMN 未通过验证；历史失败转入扫描，候选失败尝试下一项。","[Log evidence] CFUN/manual selection/query did not complete, or historical/candidate PLMN was unverified. History failure starts scanning; candidate failure tries the next candidate.",L"【日志直证】CFUN/手动选网/查询事务未完成，或历史/候选 PLMN 未通过验证；历史失败转入扫描，候选失败尝试下一项。",L"[Log evidence] CFUN/manual selection/query did not complete, or historical/candidate PLMN was unverified. History failure starts scanning; candidate failure tries the next candidate."},
{"检查对应 COPS command/status/ok 与后续候选结果；ECM 停止被拒绝不单独算选网失败，选网失败也不证明公网已掉线。","Review COPS command/status/ok and later candidates. ECM-stop rejection alone is not selection failure; selection failure does not establish a public outage.",L"检查对应 COPS command/status/ok 与后续候选结果；ECM 停止被拒绝不单独算选网失败，选网失败也不证明公网已掉线。",L"Review COPS command/status/ok and later candidates. ECM-stop rejection alone is not selection failure; selection failure does not establish a public outage."},
{"RK3506J 历史 PLMN 选网验证成功","RK3506J historical PLMN selection verified",L"RK3506J 历史 PLMN 选网验证成功",L"RK3506J historical PLMN selection verified"},
{"【源码直证】history PLMN verified 确认指定数字 PLMN 的手动 LTE 查询结果通过严格验证，随后进入 WRITE_TO_MODEM；它不代表已注册或公网已通。","[Source-code evidence] history PLMN verified confirms strict verification of the specified numeric PLMN's manual LTE query, followed by WRITE_TO_MODEM. It does not establish registration or public connectivity.",L"【源码直证】history PLMN verified 确认指定数字 PLMN 的手动 LTE 查询结果通过严格验证，随后进入 WRITE_TO_MODEM；它不代表已注册或公网已通。",L"[Source-code evidence] history PLMN verified confirms strict verification of the specified numeric PLMN's manual LTE query, followed by WRITE_TO_MODEM. It does not establish registration or public connectivity."},
{"结合后续 CEREG、PDP/ECM 和公网 PING；旧版 set operator OK 与单独 AT 命令不能提升为这条验证结论。","Review later CEREG, PDP/ECM and public PING. Legacy set operator OK or a standalone AT command does not meet this verification standard.",L"结合后续 CEREG、PDP/ECM 和公网 PING；旧版 set operator OK 与单独 AT 命令不能提升为这条验证结论。",L"Review later CEREG, PDP/ECM and public PING. Legacy set operator OK or a standalone AT command does not meet this verification standard."},
{"RK3506J EG912 恢复循环重新开始","RK3506J EG912 recovery loop restarted",L"RK3506J EG912 恢复循环重新开始",L"RK3506J EG912 recovery loop restarted"},
{"【源码直证】EG912 第四级恢复重新进入 FAILURE_RETRY 恢复循环；此事件不是恢复完成。","[Source-code evidence] EG912 level-four recovery re-enters the FAILURE_RETRY loop. This is not recovery completion.",L"【源码直证】EG912 第四级恢复重新进入 FAILURE_RETRY 恢复循环；此事件不是恢复完成。",L"[Source-code evidence] EG912 level-four recovery re-enters the FAILURE_RETRY loop. This is not recovery completion."},
{"检查随后 FAILURE_RETRY/POWER 日志及公网恢复结果；不要把循环重启当作已经切换运营商或已完成物理复位。","Review subsequent FAILURE_RETRY/POWER and public recovery. Loop restart does not establish an operator switch or completed physical reset.",L"检查随后 FAILURE_RETRY/POWER 日志及公网恢复结果；不要把循环重启当作已经切换运营商或已完成物理复位。",L"Review subsequent FAILURE_RETRY/POWER and public recovery. Loop restart does not establish an operator switch or completed physical reset."},
{"流量采样/持久化已跳过","Traffic sampling/persistence skipped",L"流量采样/持久化已跳过",L"Traffic sampling/persistence skipped"},
{"【源码直证】共享流量监控跳过采样或数据库持久化；原因可能是接口计数器、数据库、保存记录、时钟或线程异常。count 是监控累计失败次数，日志仅首次和每十次输出；不是丢包数或连续断网次数。","[Source-code evidence] Shared traffic monitoring skipped sampling/database persistence due to interface counters, database, record saving, clock or thread errors. count is cumulative monitoring failures; logging occurs first and every tenth failure. It is not lost packets or consecutive outages.",L"【源码直证】共享流量监控跳过采样或数据库持久化；原因可能是接口计数器、数据库、保存记录、时钟或线程异常。count 是监控累计失败次数，日志仅首次和每十次输出；不是丢包数或连续断网次数。",L"[Source-code evidence] Shared traffic monitoring skipped sampling/database persistence due to interface counters, database, record saving, clock or thread errors. count is cumulative monitoring failures; logging occurs first and every tenth failure. It is not lost packets or consecutive outages."},
{"按 reason 检查接口和存储/时间；落盘失败可保留内存累计值，接口读失败是缺失采样，均不能单独证明公网断网或总流量归零。","Investigate interface/storage/time by reason. Persistence failure may retain in-memory totals; interface read failure means missing samples. Neither alone establishes a public outage or zero total traffic.",L"按 reason 检查接口和存储/时间；落盘失败可保留内存累计值，接口读失败是缺失采样，均不能单独证明公网断网或总流量归零。",L"Investigate interface/storage/time by reason. Persistence failure may retain in-memory totals; interface read failure means missing samples. Neither alone establishes a public outage or zero total traffic."},
{"进程重启后丢失既有联网上下文,L1/L2/L3 恢复被门控","Restart lost existing connectivity context; L1/L2/L3 recovery gated",L"进程重启后丢失既有联网上下文,L1/L2/L3 恢复被门控",L"Restart lost existing connectivity context; L1/L2/L3 recovery gated"},
{"门控行之前已有设备数据接口在线证据；因此 never-connected 仅描述新拨号进程，","Online data-interface evidence predates the gate. never-connected describes the new dial process, ",L"门控行之前已有设备数据接口在线证据；因此 never-connected 仅描述新拨号进程，",L"Online data-interface evidence predates the gate. never-connected describes the new dial process, "},
{"不能表述为设备或 SIM 从未联网。重拉后 has_connected_once 未恢复，","not the device/SIM's lifetime connectivity. has_connected_once was not restored after restart; ",L"不能表述为设备或 SIM 从未联网。重拉后 has_connected_once 未恢复，",L"not the device/SIM's lifetime connectivity. has_connected_once was not restored after restart; "},
{"进程停留在 L0 重拨，未继续执行射频重置或 L3。","the process remained in L0 redial without radio reset or L3.",L"进程停留在 L0 重拨，未继续执行射频重置或 L3。",L"the process remained in L0 redial without radio reset or L3."},
{"修复重拉后的联网历史继承，或为 never-connected 门控设置最大持续时长；","Restore connection-history inheritance after restart, or bound the never-connected gate duration. ",L"修复重拉后的联网历史继承，或为 never-connected 门控设置最大持续时长；",L"Restore connection-history inheritance after restart, or bound the never-connected gate duration. "},
{"同时保留 SIM/APN/运营商 PDP 证据以追查首次失败。","Retain SIM/APN/operator PDP evidence to investigate the initial failure.",L"同时保留 SIM/APN/运营商 PDP 证据以追查首次失败。",L"Retain SIM/APN/operator PDP evidence to investigate the initial failure."},
{"当前拨号进程未成功联网,L1/L2/L3 恢复被 has_connected_once 门控","Current dial process never connected; has_connected_once gates L1/L2/L3",L"当前拨号进程未成功联网,L1/L2/L3 恢复被 has_connected_once 门控",L"Current dial process never connected; has_connected_once gates L1/L2/L3"},
{"日志出现 never-connected 门控行。该结论仅覆盖当前拨号进程，","A never-connected gate is recorded. This finding covers the current dial process only, ",L"日志出现 never-connected 门控行。该结论仅覆盖当前拨号进程，",L"A never-connected gate is recorded. This finding covers the current dial process only, "},
{"不推断设备历史联网情况；从未 ping 通的进程只停留在 L0。","not earlier device connectivity. A process with no successful ping remains at L0.",L"不推断设备历史联网情况；从未 ping 通的进程只停留在 L0。",L"not earlier device connectivity. A process with no successful ping remains at L0."},
{"查 SIM 数据权限、APN 和注册状态；补充故障前日志确认设备历史联网状态。","Check SIM data permissions, APN and registration. Collect preceding logs to establish historical device connectivity.",L"查 SIM 数据权限、APN 和注册状态；补充故障前日志确认设备历史联网状态。",L"Check SIM data permissions, APN and registration. Collect preceding logs to establish historical device connectivity."},
{"数据接口不可用: [HEARTBEAT-NET] 记录 IF=(none) ","Data interface unavailable: [HEARTBEAT-NET] IF=(none) ",L"数据接口不可用: [HEARTBEAT-NET] 记录 IF=(none) ",L"Data interface unavailable: [HEARTBEAT-NET] IF=(none) "},
{"【日志直证】SIM/LTE 注册状态与数据接口是不同层次。IF=(none) 表示设备当时","[Log evidence] SIM/LTE registration and the data interface are separate layers. IF=(none) means ",L"【日志直证】SIM/LTE 注册状态与数据接口是不同层次。IF=(none) 表示设备当时",L"[Log evidence] SIM/LTE registration and the data interface are separate layers. IF=(none) means "},
{"没有可用数据接口；它可直接证明 PDP/数据呼叫未建立或已释放，不能单独定责","no usable data interface existed then, directly showing PDP/data call absent or released; it alone cannot assign responsibility ",L"没有可用数据接口；它可直接证明 PDP/数据呼叫未建立或已释放，不能单独定责",L"no usable data interface existed then, directly showing PDP/data call absent or released; it alone cannot assign responsibility "},
{"为运营商、SIM、APN 或模组。","to the operator, SIM, APN or module.",L"为运营商、SIM、APN 或模组。",L"to the operator, SIM, APN or module."},
