{"结合 PDP 激活结果、CEER、CGACT/CGATT、实际 APN 和运营商 PDP/ESM 原因码定责；","Use PDP activation, CEER, CGACT/CGATT, actual APN and operator PDP/ESM reason codes to investigate. ",L"结合 PDP 激活结果、CEER、CGACT/CGATT、实际 APN 和运营商 PDP/ESM 原因码定责；",L"Use PDP activation, CEER, CGACT/CGATT, actual APN and operator PDP/ESM reason codes to investigate. "},
{"不要仅以 REG=1 判断设备在线。","REG=1 alone does not establish device connectivity.",L"不要仅以 REG=1 判断设备在线。",L"REG=1 alone does not establish device connectivity."},
{"手动选网解除后恢复注册（强关联） ","Registration recovered after manual-selection release (strong association) ",L"手动选网解除后恢复注册（强关联） ",L"Registration recovered after manual-selection release (strong association) "},
{"【强关联推断】同一日志来源先由 AT+COPS? 确认处于手动选网(mode=1)，","[Strong-association inference] AT+COPS? first confirmed manual mode=1 in the same source, ",L"【强关联推断】同一日志来源先由 AT+COPS? 确认处于手动选网(mode=1)，",L"[Strong-association inference] AT+COPS? first confirmed manual mode=1 in the same source, "},
{"随后成功执行 AT+COPS=0，之后才出现注册/连接成功。手动锁网是本次","AT+COPS=0 then succeeded, followed by registration/connection success. Manual lock is the primary local suspect ",L"随后成功执行 AT+COPS=0，之后才出现注册/连接成功。手动锁网是本次",L"AT+COPS=0 then succeeded, followed by registration/connection success. Manual lock is the primary local suspect "},
{"未注册的首要本地侧嫌疑，但日志不能排除网络侧同时恢复，不能断言为唯一根因。","for this unregistered episode, but simultaneous network recovery remains possible; it is not a proven sole cause.",L"未注册的首要本地侧嫌疑，但日志不能排除网络侧同时恢复，不能断言为唯一根因。",L"for this unregistered episode, but simultaneous network recovery remains possible; it is not a proven sole cause."},
{" 此前存在应用自身的 AT+COPS=1/运营商选择日志，锁网来源可追溯至应用流程。"," Earlier application AT+COPS=1/operator-selection logs trace the lock to the application flow.",L" 此前存在应用自身的 AT+COPS=1/运营商选择日志，锁网来源可追溯至应用流程。",L" Earlier application AT+COPS=1/operator-selection logs trace the lock to the application flow."},
{" 未见此前应用选网命令，锁网来源未知（可能来自旧会话或外部 AT 客户端）。"," No preceding application selection command was observed; the lock's origin is unknown (possibly an earlier session or external AT client).",L" 未见此前应用选网命令，锁网来源未知（可能来自旧会话或外部 AT 客户端）。",L" No preceding application selection command was observed; the lock's origin is unknown (possibly an earlier session or external AT client)."},
{"追查手动选网来源；若业务不要求固定运营商，启动发现 mode=1 且未注册时","Trace the manual-selection origin. If a fixed operator is not required, switch to AT+COPS=0 promptly when startup finds unregistered mode=1, ",L"追查手动选网来源；若业务不要求固定运营商，启动发现 mode=1 且未注册时",L"Trace the manual-selection origin. If a fixed operator is not required, switch to AT+COPS=0 promptly when startup finds unregistered mode=1, "},
