{"【日志直证】已确认 mode=1 并收到 COPS=0 成功应答，但当前日志片段之后","[Log evidence] mode=1 was confirmed and COPS=0 succeeded, but the current log fragment contains ",L"【日志直证】已确认 mode=1 并收到 COPS=0 成功应答，但当前日志片段之后",L"[Log evidence] mode=1 was confirmed and COPS=0 succeeded, but the current log fragment contains "},
