{"补充 COPS=0 后的 CEREG、状态迁移和 DataCall 日志；同时检查运营商覆盖与账户状态。","Collect CEREG, state transitions and DataCall after COPS=0; also review coverage and account status.",L"补充 COPS=0 后的 CEREG、状态迁移和 DataCall 日志；同时检查运营商覆盖与账户状态。",L"Collect CEREG, state transitions and DataCall after COPS=0; also review coverage and account status."},
{"检测到手动选网模式，尚无完整恢复证据","Manual operator selection detected; recovery evidence incomplete",L"检测到手动选网模式，尚无完整恢复证据",L"Manual operator selection detected; recovery evidence incomplete"},
{"【日志直证】AT+COPS? 返回 mode=1；仅有手动状态，尚无同源的 COPS=0 成功","[Log evidence] AT+COPS? returned mode=1. Manual state alone lacks a same-source successful COPS=0 ",L"【日志直证】AT+COPS? 返回 mode=1；仅有手动状态，尚无同源的 COPS=0 成功",L"[Log evidence] AT+COPS? returned mode=1. Manual state alone lacks a same-source successful COPS=0 "},
