{"补充 COPS=0 应答与后续 CEREG/连接日志；若业务不要求固定运营商，检查手动选网来源。","Collect COPS=0 and subsequent CEREG/connection logs. Trace manual selection if the business does not require a fixed operator.",L"补充 COPS=0 应答与后续 CEREG/连接日志；若业务不要求固定运营商，检查手动选网来源。",L"Collect COPS=0 and subsequent CEREG/connection logs. Trace manual selection if the business does not require a fixed operator."},
